
>> Size := Obýekt täze.
Size gelende: ['is:'] et: { :san
	san gelende: ['+'] et: { :san
		>> unit := san ölçeg-birligi.
		>> factor := 1.
		
		unit
		ýagdaý: ['inch'] et: { factor := 0.0833. }. <- özi + (san * factor).
	}. <- san.
}.

# This size number can be used as follows:

>> plank := Size is: 6 foot.
>> edge := Size is: 50 inch.

# This will show as: 10.165
Çykyş ýaz: plank + edge, täze-setir.
